    "readme_description": "Given a set of **distinct** positive integers `nums`, return the largest subset `answer` such that every pair `(answer[i], answer[j])` of elements in this subset satisfies:\n\n- `answer[i] % answer[j] == 0`, or\n- `answer[j] % answer[i] == 0`\n\nIf there are multiple solutions, return any of them.",
